WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.940
Module 12.

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:03.695
Operate as Your Own Bank.

00:00:03.695 --> 00:00:05.580
Part of Stage 5, Operator.

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.161
By the end of this module, you'll be

00:00:09.161 --> 00:00:11.380
able to run your crypto like a bank

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:14.339
runs its book: a balance sheet, custody policy,

00:00:14.339 --> 00:00:17.475
a credit line, a liquidity ladder and records.

00:00:17.475 --> 00:00:18.830
That's the standard.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:20.800
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.206
There are 8 lessons, starting with

00:00:24.206 --> 00:00:27.395
Your balance sheet: assets, liabilities, equity.

00:00:27.395 --> 00:00:29.374
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:29.374 --> 00:00:31.645
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:32.945 --> 00:00:34.540
If the topic is new to

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:37.405
you, start with Mastery Starter 12.0.

00:00:37.405 --> 00:00:39.300
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.454
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:41.454 --> 00:00:43.585
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:45.392
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:45.392 --> 00:00:47.425
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:48.725 --> 00:00:51.260
Let's begin, with lesson 12.0.
